function noteIconName(note,index){const n=String(note).toLowerCase();if(/ليمون|برغموت|تفاح|lemon|bergamot|apple/.test(n))return'citrus';if(/زهر|ورد|لافندر|flower|blossom|lavender/.test(n))return'flower';if(/خشب|بتولا|wood|birch/.test(n))return'wood';if(/قرفة|فلفل|هيل|قهوة|تمر|cinnamon|pepper|cardamom|coffee|dates/.test(n))return'spice';return['spice','flower','wood'][index%3]}
 function productCard(p){const label=currentLang==='ar'?p.ar:p.name,add=currentLang==='ar'?'أضف للسلة':'Add to bag',discount=p.old?Math.round((1-p.price/p.old)*100):0;return `<article class="product-card" data-tags="${p.tags.join(' ')}" data-name="${p.ar} ${p.name} ${p.brand}"><div class="product-image"><span class="badge ${p.tone==='wine'?'wine':''}">${badgeText(p)}</span><button class="wish ${favorites.has(p.id)?'active':''}" data-wish="${p.id}" aria-label="${currentLang==='ar'?'إضافة للمفضلة':'Add to wishlist'}">${favorites.has(p.id)?'♥':'♡'}</button><img src="assets/products/${p.img}" alt="${label} by ${p.brand}" loading="lazy" data-quick="${p.id}"><button class="quick-view" data-quick="${p.id}">${currentLang==='ar'?'عرض المنتج':'View product'}</button></div><div class="product-info"><span class="product-brand">${p.brand}</span><h3>${label}</h3><div class="product-meta">EDP · 100ml</div><div class="rating">★ ${p.rating} <span>(${p.reviews})</span></div><div class="product-bottom"><div class="price"><b>${money(p.price)}</b>${p.old?`<del>${money(p.old)}</del><em class="discount-pill">-${discount}%</em>`:''}</div><div class="card-actions"><button class="add-btn" data-add="${p.id}" aria-label="${add}">${uiIcon('bag')}<span>${add}</span></button><button class="detail-peek" data-quick="${p.id}" aria-label="${currentLang==='ar'?'عرض سريع':'Quick view'}">◉</button></div></div><label class="compare-check"><input type="checkbox" data-compare="${p.id}" ${compareIds.has(p.id)?'checked':''}> ${currentLang==='ar'?'أضف للمقارنة':'Add to compare'}</label></div></article>`}
function renderProducts(filter='all',query=''){const list=products.filter(p=>!p.hidden&&(filter==='all'||p.tags.includes(filter))&&(`${p.ar} ${p.name} ${p.brand}`.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase())));$('#product-grid').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(productCard).join(''):`<p style="grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:50px;color:#766b6c">${currentLang==='ar'?'لم نجد عطرًا مطابقًا. جرّب كلمة أخرى.':'No matching fragrance found. Try another search.'}</p>`}
const renderProductsBasic=renderProducts;
renderProducts=function(filter='all',query=''){let list=products.filter(p=>!p.hidden&&(filter==='all'||p.tags.includes(filter))&&(`${p.ar} ${p.name} ${p.brand}`.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()))&&(!catalogFilters.brand||p.brand===catalogFilters.brand)&&p.price>=catalogFilters.min&&p.price<=catalogFilters.max&&Number(p.rating)>=catalogFilters.rating);if(catalogSort==='price-asc')list.sort((a,b)=>a.price-b.price);if(catalogSort==='price-desc')list.sort((a,b)=>b.price-a.price);if(catalogSort==='rating')list.sort((a,b)=>Number(b.rating)-Number(a.rating));$('#product-grid').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(productCard).join(''):`<p style="grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:50px;color:#766b6c">${currentLang==='ar'?'لم نجد عطرًا مطابقًا. جرّب تعديل الفلاتر.':'No matching fragrance found. Try adjusting your filters.'}</p>`;const count=$('#catalog-count');if(count)count.textContent=currentLang==='ar'?`${list.length} منتجات`:`${list.length} products`;const active=[catalogFilters.brand,catalogFilters.min>0,catalogFilters.max<99999,catalogFilters.rating>0].filter(Boolean).length;const badge=$('#active-filter-count');if(badge)badge.textContent=active}
function iconizeProductControls(root=document){$$('.wish,.detail-peek',root).forEach(button=>{button.innerHTML=uiIcon(button.classList.contains('detail-peek')?'eye':'heart')})}
const renderProductsIconBase=renderProducts;
renderProducts=function(filter='all',query=''){renderProductsIconBase(filter,query);iconizeProductControls($('#product-grid'))}
function searchMatches(query){const q=query.trim().toLowerCase(),visible=products.filter(p=>!p.hidden);if(!q)return visible.slice(0,4);return visible.filter(p=>{const d=details?.[currentLang]?.[p.id],haystack=[p.ar,p.name,p.brand,...(d?.notes||[])].join(' ').toLowerCase();return haystack.includes(q)}).slice(0,5)}
function renderSearchSuggestions(query=''){const root=$('#search-suggestions'),ar=currentLang==='ar',matches=searchMatches(query);if(!query.trim()){const tags=recentSearches.length?recentSearches:(ar?['عطور شرقية','LATTAFA','الأكثر مبيعًا']:['Oriental','LATTAFA','Bestsellers']);root.innerHTML=`<div class="suggestion-head"><span>${ar?'عمليات بحث حديثة':'Recent searches'}</span>${recentSearches.length?`<button data-clear-searches>${ar?'مسح':'Clear'}</button>`:''}</div><div class="suggestion-tags">${tags.map(t=>`<button data-search-term="${t}">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="suggestion-head"><span>${ar?'الأكثر طلبًا':'Popular now'}</span></div>`+matches.map(suggestionItem).join('')}else root.innerHTML=matches.length?`<div class="suggestion-head"><span>${ar?`نتائج البحث (${matches.length})`:`Search results (${matches.length})`}</span></div>`+matches.map(suggestionItem).join(''):`<div class="suggestion-empty">${ar?'لم نجد نتيجة مطابقة. جرّب اسمًا أو ماركة أخرى.':'No matching result. Try another name or brand.'}</div>`;root.classList.add('open')}
function suggestionItem(p){const label=currentLang==='ar'?p.ar:p.name;return `<button class="suggestion-item" role="option" data-quick="${p.id}"><img src="assets/products/${p.img}" alt=""><span><b>${label}</b><small>${p.brand} · EDP 100ml · ★ ${p.rating}</small></span><span>${money(p.price)}</span></button>`}
function closeSearchSuggestions(){$('#search-suggestions').classList.remove('open')}
function persist(){localStorage.setItem('origo-cart',JSON.stringify(cart));localStorage.setItem('origo-favs',JSON.stringify([...favorites]))}
function toast(msg){const t=$('.toast');t.textContent=msg;t.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2200)}
function addToCart(id){const item=cart.find(x=>x.id===id);item?item.qty++:cart.push({id,qty:1});persist();renderCart();toast(currentLang==='ar'?'تمت إضافة العطر إلى سلتك':'Fragrance added to your bag')}
function renderCart(){const count=cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.qty,0);$$('.cart-count').forEach(x=>x.textContent=count);$('#cart-summary').textContent=currentLang==='ar'?`${count} منتجات`:`${count} items`;const box=$('#cart-items');box.innerHTML=cart.map(item=>{const p=products.find(x=>x.id===item.id),label=currentLang==='ar'?p.ar:p.name;return `<div class="cart-item"><img src="assets/products/${p.img}" alt="${label}"><div><h4>${label}</h4><small>${currentLang==='ar'?'الكمية':'Quantity'}: ${item.qty}</small><b>${money(p.price*item.qty)}</b></div><button class="remove-item" data-remove="${p.id}" aria-label="${currentLang==='ar'?'حذف':'Remove'}">×</button></div>`}).join('');const has=cart.length>0;$('#empty-cart').style.display=has?'none':'block';$('#cart-footer').classList.toggle('visible',has);$('#cart-total').textContent=money(cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+products.find(p=>p.id===x.id).price*x.qty,0))}
const renderCartSimple=renderCart;
renderCart=function(){renderCartSimple();const has=cart.length>0,totalBefore=cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+products.find(p=>p.id===x.id).price*x.qty,0),total=totalBefore-promoDiscount;$$('.cart-item').forEach(row=>{const id=row.querySelector('[data-remove]')?.dataset.remove,item=cart.find(x=>x.id===id),small=row.querySelector('small');if(!item||!small)return;small.outerHTML=`<div class="qty-control"><button data-qty="${id}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="${currentLang==='ar'?'تقليل الكمية':'Decrease quantity'}">−</button><span>${item.qty}</span><button data-qty="${id}" data-delta="1" aria-label="${currentLang==='ar'?'زيادة الكمية':'Increase quantity'}">＋</button></div>`});let extras=$('#cart-extras');if(!extras){extras=document.createElement('div');extras.id='cart-extras';extras.className='cart-extras';$('#cart-items').insertAdjacentElement('afterend',extras)}extras.style.display=has?'block':'none';extras.innerHTML=has?`<div class="promo-box"><div class="promo-title">${uiIcon('gift')}<div><b>${currentLang==='ar'?'كوبون الخصم':'Promo code'}</b><small>${currentLang==='ar'?'استخدم ORIGO10 للحصول على خصم':'Use ORIGO10 to unlock a discount'}</small></div></div><div class="promo-form"><input id="promo-input" placeholder="${currentLang==='ar'?'أدخل كود الخصم':'Enter promo code'}" value="${promoDiscount?'ORIGO10':''}"><button data-apply-promo>${currentLang==='ar'?'تطبيق':'Apply'}</button></div>${promoDiscount?`<p class="promo-success">✓ ${currentLang==='ar'?`تم تطبيق خصم ${money(promoDiscount)}`:`${money(promoDiscount)} discount applied`}</p>`:''}</div><div class="rewards-box">${uiIcon('gift')}<div><b>ORIGO Rewards</b><small>${currentLang==='ar'?'لديك 320 نقطة · استبدل نقاطك بخصم':'You have 320 points · Redeem for a discount'}</small></div><button data-redeem-points>${currentLang==='ar'?'استبدال':'Redeem'}</button></div>`:'';$('#cart-total').textContent=money(total);const footer=$('#cart-footer');if(footer&&promoDiscount)footer.querySelector('div').insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<small class="saved-label">${currentLang==='ar'?'وفّرت':'You saved'} ${money(promoDiscount)}</small>`)}
const renderCartWithCleanLabels=renderCart;
renderCart=function(){$$('.saved-label').forEach(x=>x.remove());renderCartWithCleanLabels()}
const renderCartClampedBase=renderCart;
renderCart=function(){if(!cart.length)promoDiscount=0;renderCartClampedBase();const total=cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+products.find(p=>p.id===x.id).price*x.qty,0);$('#cart-total').textContent=money(Math.max(0,total-promoDiscount))}
